[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=18 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="机器停下以后，水管没有立即出水。所有人站在平台上等了一会儿，只有一只松动的螺母从高处落下来，在铁板上滚了很远。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="它是不是又坏了一次？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="不是。先泄压。你们往后退，别站接口正对面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她拧松旁通阀，管子里终于传出水流声。一个穿旧雨衣的女人先把杯子放在下面，等了几秒，又拿走，换成更大的桶。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="女人"

text="今天让孩子先洗手。水够的话，再洗脸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这样就算修好了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="今天算。明天还得有人来查密封，后天也一样。关掉会伤人的部分，不会让剩下的东西自己变好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们帮着把旧中继从水里拖上来。上面钉着教团的铭牌，铭牌下面却露出另一组磨损的编号，和交换站记录里的一致。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="留原件。把接线顺序照下来，不能只拿一块招牌回去说“都是他们干的”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我负责那边的杯子。有人一直问能不能再倒一点，我总不能替拉姆森跟每个人谈密封。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们留一艘到天黑。其他人送记录回港。水要是再停，先救急，再查原因。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你被分到返港的船上。临走，老人从维修铺托人送来一枚新的接地片，纸袋里没写感谢，只标了适配的螺丝尺寸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="他相信我们能用上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="他知道我们要用。两件事差一点，不过今天够了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="平台上那截新布被重新绑高，离开了浪能打到的地方。你记下位置，知道以后路过这里时，有一件非常具体的事可以回来确认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "lamson", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

